_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-09T21:10:35Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T15:35:28Z","closed_at":"2026-02-25T15:35:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116112","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116112","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116112.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116112.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Problem\r\nWhen loading malformed or truncated WAV files, Godot's WAV parser could enter an infinite loop, causing the editor or runtime to hang. The issue is related to FileAccessMemory reading beyond file boundaries.\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n- Added safety checks to clamp chunk sizes to the actual file length.\r\n- Ensured the file cursor always moves forward to prevent infinite loops.\r\n- Added validation for INFO and LIST chunks to prevent reading past chunk bounds.\r\n\r\nThis resolves #116099 and improves the stability of the WAV importer.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n- Tested with various valid WAV files (8/16/32/64-bit, mono/stereo).\r\n- Tested with truncated and malformed WAV files to ensure no infinite loop occurs.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"ht